# ── Portal disk-only assets ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deliberately NOT tracked (see CLAUDE.md "Site-wide editorial rules"):
#   portal/images/  efhw/images/   the WeChat group QR is regenerated roughly
#                           weekly, so tracking it would mean a churn commit
#                           every week
#   portal/IMG_*            raw source photos
# Both are still shipped: portal/deploy.sh tars the WORKING TREE, not the git
# index, so production is unaffected by these rules.
# Spelled out here because `git add portal/` silently swept them into a commit
# twice on 2026-09-12 while editing the blog series and the FT-710 archive.
portal/images/
portal/IMG_*
efhw/images/
